## Red-team stack

| Tool          | Role                                     |
| ------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| **Promptfoo** | Rapid automated red teaming + regression |
| **Garak**     | LLM vulnerability scanning               |
| **PyRIT**     | Adversarial orchestration + scoring      |
| Custom Python | Your own attack/scoring engine           |

Garak is specifically designed as an LLM vulnerability scanner and supports probes for areas including prompt injection, data leakage and jailbreaks. ([GitHub](https://github.com/NVIDIA/garak?utm_source=chatgpt.com "GitHub - NVIDIA/garak: the LLM vulnerability scanner · GitHub"))

Promptfoo currently supports automated red teaming across many vulnerability categories and can test HTTP/API targets and integrate with CI/CD. ([GitHub](https://github.com/promptfoo/promptfoo/blob/main/site/docs/red-team/quickstart.md?utm_source=chatgpt.com "promptfoo/site/docs/red-team/quickstart.md at main · promptfoo/promptfoo · GitHub"))

PyRIT provides targets, attack orchestration, conversation memory and flexible scoring, making it useful for the deeper assessment layer. ([GitHub](https://github.com/microsoft/PyRIT/blob/main/doc/index.md?utm_source=chatgpt.com "PyRIT/doc/index.md at main · microsoft/PyRIT · GitHub"))
